(4285072, 618981, 53147, '<td valign="top">A little too much NI or soft glow added for my tastes. The tilt of the bars makes the image feel a bit off balance to my eye. Great colors though.</td>', 'A little too much NI or soft glow added for my tastes. The tilt of the bars makes the image feel a bit off balance to my eye. Great colors though.', '2007-12-03 08:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285073, 618958, 53147, '<td valign="top">Not familiar with this fairy tale. Cool location and nice fresh snow. Would have been much cooler without the tire tracks but whatcha gonna do about that.</td>', 'Not familiar with this fairy tale. Cool location and nice fresh snow. Would have been much cooler without the tire tracks but whatcha gonna do about that.', '2007-12-03 08:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285074, 618436, 68035, '<td valign="top">Context wise meets the challenge well.  Unfortunate about the level of noise and the reflection of light in the eyes.  Possibly could have done with a closer crop to exclude the boy in the check shirt</td>', 'Context wise meets the challenge well.  Unfortunate about the level of noise and the reflection of light in the eyes.  Possibly could have done with a closer crop to exclude the boy in the check shirt', '2007-12-03 08:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285076, 619248, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and a very nice staged shot.  Good sharpness and the butterfly and ''magic dust'' are very nice touches</td>', 'Lovely colours and a very nice staged shot.  Good sharpness and the butterfly and ''magic dust'' are very nice touches', '2007-12-03 08:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285078, 618939, 68035, '<td valign="top">Made me smile and I hope people get the subtlty of the humour (especially speed voters) very nice colouring of the frog</td>', 'Made me smile and I hope people get the subtlty of the humour (especially speed voters) very nice colouring of the frog', '2007-12-03 08:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285079, 619181, 53147, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. There is something about the editing that isnt grabbing me though. I think I wish for a darker feel to the scenery.</td>', 'Interesting shot. There is something about the editing that isnt grabbing me though. I think I wish for a darker feel to the scenery.', '2007-12-03 08:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285080, 619250, 53147, '<td valign="top">Decent shot of a butterfly but it just isnt screaming fairy tale to me.</td>', 'Decent shot of a butterfly but it just isnt screaming fairy tale to me.', '2007-12-03 08:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285081, 619063, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I am really not digging the editing on this image. A bit too funky for my tastes.</td>', 'Good idea but I am really not digging the editing on this image. A bit too funky for my tastes.', '2007-12-03 08:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285082, 618614, 68035, '<td valign="top">OK, I am still early in voting in the challenge but this is the first shot that has stopped me in my tracks.  The use of infrared and the fantastic colour PP on top of this has created a truly magical effect.  I can almost hear the running water and see the nymphs and fawns leaping around<br/> <br/>Super shot 9 (and I could well be back to bump upwards later)</td>', 'OK, I am still early in voting in the challenge but this is the first shot that has stopped me in my tracks.  The use of infrared and the fantastic colour PP on top of this has created a truly magical effect.  I can almost hear the running water and see the nymphs and fawns leaping around Super shot 9 (and I could well be back to bump upwards later)', '2007-12-03 08:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285083, 618752, 53147, '<td valign="top">Better use of a statue/toy than many in the challenge. But the overall softness is a detriment to the image IMO.</td>', 'Better use of a statue/toy than many in the challenge. But the overall softness is a detriment to the image IMO.', '2007-12-03 08:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285084, 618716, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice snow/ice queen image.  The contrasting of the pure white and the blue of the background works very well</td>', 'Nice snow/ice queen image.  The contrasting of the pure white and the blue of the background works very well', '2007-12-03 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285085, 618959, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice depiction of the scene from the story... clothing is very appropriate and I like the muted and natural colors.  Something about the processing feels off.. perhaps bumping the dark tones to be a bit darker would help?  I picture the scene in a dark scary forest, and this seems a bit bright perhaps.</td>', 'Nice depiction of the scene from the story... clothing is very appropriate and I like the muted and natural colors.  Something about the processing feels off.. perhaps bumping the dark tones to be a bit darker would help?  I picture the scene in a dark scary forest, and this seems a bit bright perhaps.', '2007-12-03 08:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285088, 617171, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great mystical feeling to this.  You''re a bit too clean shaven to pull off being asleep for 100 years though!</td>', 'Great mystical feeling to this.  You''re a bit too clean shaven to pull off being asleep for 100 years though!', '2007-12-03 08:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285091, 618946, 81382, '<td valign="top">Looks incredibly overprocessed and have become a cross between a painting and CGI. Some might think its great and fits the challange well but its not for me.</td>', 'Looks incredibly overprocessed and have become a cross between a painting and CGI. Some might think its great and fits the challange well but its not for me.', '2007-12-03 08:44:05.000000', NULL, 1);
