(4285098, 618318, 81382, '<td valign="top">The DOF looks a little faked, there seems to be a bit of a blur halo around the apple which isn''t natural to me. The background looks nice but the apple itself is not in keeping with the rest of the image somehow. A bit too much post processing - its very high contrast, the specular highlights are burned out and the apple is very strongly colour saturated.</td>', 'The DOF looks a little faked, there seems to be a bit of a blur halo around the apple which isn''t natural to me. The background looks nice but the apple itself is not in keeping with the rest of the image somehow. A bit too much post processing - its very high contrast, the specular highlights are burned out and the apple is very strongly colour saturated.', '2007-12-03 08:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285100, 618333, 28172, '<td valign="top">That''s too funny! 10 for making me laugh!  I love it.</td>', 'That''s too funny! 10 for making me laugh!  I love it.', '2007-12-03 08:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285101, 619147, 68035, '<td valign="top">Love the understated nature of this shot.  Subtle and clever with super sharpness on the bread and leaves.  Not too sure about the trainers in the background, maybe just another peice of bokeh bread would have been better<br/> <br/>Still excellent as it is</td>', 'Love the understated nature of this shot.  Subtle and clever with super sharpness on the bread and leaves.  Not too sure about the trainers in the background, maybe just another peice of bokeh bread would have been better Still excellent as it is', '2007-12-03 08:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4285106, 618244, 81382, '<td valign="top">Where does the apply come into this? A reflection of a pretty girl would have perhaps been more fitting. Nice colours and dreamy, blurry lighting effects</td>', 'Where does the apply come into this? A reflection of a pretty girl would have perhaps been more fitting. Nice colours and dreamy, blurry lighting effects', '2007-12-03 08:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
