(4286581, 618948, 22301, '<td valign="top">I imagine you are getting a not so good score with the shoehorn title/entry. I think the photo itself is excellent, you got some wonderful expressions on the bride and groom and they look very happy. But doesn''t really fit what the challenge was about.</td>', 'I imagine you are getting a not so good score with the shoehorn title/entry. I think the photo itself is excellent, you got some wonderful expressions on the bride and groom and they look very happy. But doesn''t really fit what the challenge was about.', '2007-12-03 19:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
