(4286589, 619248, 22301, '<td valign="top">looks like she is having a good time :)  excellent lighting and I like the little extra effort of the sprinkles and butterfly</td>', 'looks like she is having a good time :)  excellent lighting and I like the little extra effort of the sprinkles and butterfly', '2007-12-03 19:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
