(4286621, 619025, 22301, '<td valign="top">cool shot and pose, her eyes really give the feeling of mischief. You seem to have lost some details with neat image or blur. I try to copy  the image and apply the effect, then mask out what I don''t want effected. I think it works on her face but unnecessary for her hair and clothing. just my opinion though. I think will do well. :)</td>', 'cool shot and pose, her eyes really give the feeling of mischief. You seem to have lost some details with neat image or blur. I try to copy  the image and apply the effect, then mask out what I don''t want effected. I think it works on her face but unnecessary for her hair and clothing. just my opinion though. I think will do well. :)', '2007-12-03 19:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4286628, 618898, 22301, '<td valign="top">nice composition, but it doesn''t appear too sharp, especially on the mouse. I like the lighting especially how are the shadows are nicely filled in with light.</td>', 'nice composition, but it doesn''t appear too sharp, especially on the mouse. I like the lighting especially how are the shadows are nicely filled in with light.', '2007-12-03 19:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
