(4290945, 617672, 65035, '<td valign="top">Clever reflection.</td>', 'Clever reflection.', '2007-12-05 08:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4291109, 619205, 81382, '<td valign="top">Quite a strange depth of field effect you have going on but the face is in focus which is the important thing here so thats good. Not sure the red colouring works, normally you would have single coloured objects in a mostly mono image to draw attention, but here, the red elements are not in focus and the main points of interest given you title and the brief should be the boy and the book which are left mono. So your intention by doing this colouring seems a little confused. Mono tones could have been pushed harder as they are a little washed out</td>', 'Quite a strange depth of field effect you have going on but the face is in focus which is the important thing here so thats good. Not sure the red colouring works, normally you would have single coloured objects in a mostly mono image to draw attention, but here, the red elements are not in focus and the main points of interest given you title and the brief should be the boy and the book which are left mono. So your intention by doing this colouring seems a little confused. Mono tones could have been pushed harder as they are a little washed out', '2007-12-05 08:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4291117, 619222, 81382, '<td valign="top">Don''t really get the title, not sure if I should be looking at the tree or the buildings.</td>', 'Don''t really get the title, not sure if I should be looking at the tree or the buildings.', '2007-12-05 08:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4291121, 618669, 81382, '<td valign="top">I don''t recall this particular fairy tale. Your choice of subjects just seem a little too "random" for me to score this particularly highly</td>', 'I don''t recall this particular fairy tale. Your choice of subjects just seem a little too "random" for me to score this particularly highly', '2007-12-05 08:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4291130, 619168, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely colouring on the leaves. Well composed, the tree trunk a third in from the right. Uncomplicated blurry background with weak colouring puts the emphasis on the leaves so thats good. Not sure I like the tree trunk being out of focus though, it makes it look too detached from the leaves. Perhaps would have been better if there were some out of focus leaves in front of the trunk, as it is, it looks a bit like this is a seperate tree in the foreground and the real tree trunk with the leaves attached is behind</td>', 'Lovely colouring on the leaves. Well composed, the tree trunk a third in from the right. Uncomplicated blurry background with weak colouring puts the emphasis on the leaves so thats good. Not sure I like the tree trunk being out of focus though, it makes it look too detached from the leaves. Perhaps would have been better if there were some out of focus leaves in front of the trunk, as it is, it looks a bit like this is a seperate tree in the foreground and the real tree trunk with the leaves attached is behind', '2007-12-05 08:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4291143, 619249, 81382, '<td valign="top">The background, despite being blurred is quite strongly coloured and draws attention away from the mostly pink coloured subjects. Can''t help but feel the face of the fairy could be more in focus. The left eye is but not the right but yet the centre of the flower right at the bottom is well focused which spoils the composition a bit as it further draws attention away from the fairy and in this case, out of the bottom of the image.</td>', 'The background, despite being blurred is quite strongly coloured and draws attention away from the mostly pink coloured subjects. Can''t help but feel the face of the fairy could be more in focus. The left eye is but not the right but yet the centre of the flower right at the bottom is well focused which spoils the composition a bit as it further draws attention away from the fairy and in this case, out of the bottom of the image.', '2007-12-05 08:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4291487, 618333, 67697, '<td valign="top">omg you are so bold and brave - thank you so much for the great laugh this morning.  Do be sure to pull this picture out when she starts dating LOL</td>', 'omg you are so bold and brave - thank you so much for the great laugh this morning.  Do be sure to pull this picture out when she starts dating LOL', '2007-12-05 10:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
