(4292379, 618318, 6771, '<td valign="top">Love the bokeh, setup. and idea, but the apple, for some reason, looks oversaturated and dark.</td>', 'Love the bokeh, setup. and idea, but the apple, for some reason, looks oversaturated and dark.', '2007-12-05 13:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292382, 618436, 73770, '<td valign="top">Eeek, too grainy!!</td>', 'Eeek, too grainy!!', '2007-12-05 13:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292396, 619201, 6771, '<td valign="top">Good work on not blowing out the lighting with those gold beans.  Lighting at a different angle (other than straight on) and the bag and beans in a different scene may give it more interest, than..."Hmmmm...gold beans and a bag."</td>', 'Good work on not blowing out the lighting with those gold beans.  Lighting at a different angle (other than straight on) and the bag and beans in a different scene may give it more interest, than..."Hmmmm...gold beans and a bag."', '2007-12-05 13:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292415, 618961, 6771, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think a better setup would have worked better. a different angle or something.  My eye gets drawn from the dress to the window, because my mind is expecting to find a face above the neck, and instead there is the window.  The colored shutters detract from the main focus of the image also.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think a better setup would have worked better. a different angle or something.  My eye gets drawn from the dress to the window, because my mind is expecting to find a face above the neck, and instead there is the window.  The colored shutters detract from the main focus of the image also.', '2007-12-05 13:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292431, 619020, 6771, '<td valign="top">Not sure why, but the yellowish colors just take away from this picture.  I am sure the figurine is that color, just that it isn''t really interesting.  The pixie dust is a good touch.</td>', 'Not sure why, but the yellowish colors just take away from this picture.  I am sure the figurine is that color, just that it isn''t really interesting.  The pixie dust is a good touch.', '2007-12-05 13:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292440, 619063, 6771, '<td valign="top">Way too oversaturated colors on a selective saturated photo.  To the point where you see the color changes and a line around the beans.  Nice idea, though.</td>', 'Way too oversaturated colors on a selective saturated photo.  To the point where you see the color changes and a line around the beans.  Nice idea, though.', '2007-12-05 13:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292448, 618366, 6771, '<td valign="top">Pretty, nice reflection, and nice colors, but not really interesting and nothing really to focus on.  My eyes keep wandering around trying to find something to rest upon, I think mainly because the focus seems a bit off, nothing sharp to catch the eye.</td>', 'Pretty, nice reflection, and nice colors, but not really interesting and nothing really to focus on.  My eyes keep wandering around trying to find something to rest upon, I think mainly because the focus seems a bit off, nothing sharp to catch the eye.', '2007-12-05 13:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292452, 619168, 6771, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors, but not a lot of interest to look at it more than a few seconds.  A stock photo for an advert pertaining to fall...great.</td>', 'Pretty colors, but not a lot of interest to look at it more than a few seconds.  A stock photo for an advert pertaining to fall...great.', '2007-12-05 13:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292497, 619205, 6771, '<td valign="top">I don''t think selectively saturating the red was the best idea.  It detracts away from the main subject.  I keep looking into the left, bottom corner.</td>', 'I don''t think selectively saturating the red was the best idea.  It detracts away from the main subject.  I keep looking into the left, bottom corner.', '2007-12-05 14:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292502, 618736, 6771, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to seen a little more lighting, to see some detail.  Nice colored lighting though.</td>', 'I would have liked to seen a little more lighting, to see some detail.  Nice colored lighting though.', '2007-12-05 14:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4292964, 618333, 811, '<td valign="top">OMG, you are so not right.  I can''t wait to see this on the front page and in the "funniest pictures ever" thread, cuz that is where it needs to be.</td>', 'OMG, you are so not right.  I can''t wait to see this on the front page and in the "funniest pictures ever" thread, cuz that is where it needs to be.', '2007-12-05 15:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
