(4293112, 618333, 66952, '<td valign="top">No! No! NO! This is just...so...WRONG! <br/> <br/>I *love* the boxers under the skirt. That just makes it work so much better.</td>', 'No! No! NO! This is just...so...WRONG!  I *love* the boxers under the skirt. That just makes it work so much better.', '2007-12-05 16:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4293118, 618820, 66952, '<td valign="top">The idea is good. Having the sword blade running exactly along the line of the tower kind of hides it.</td>', 'The idea is good. Having the sword blade running exactly along the line of the tower kind of hides it.', '2007-12-05 16:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4293668, 619226, 85886, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot - I love that it''s just so bold.  The apple red is perfect (no idea how much you tweaked it but it looks inviting yet beautifully dark) and the framing/crop really works.  A lovely interpretation of the challenge.  Well done! :)</td>', 'Fabulous shot - I love that it''s just so bold.  The apple red is perfect (no idea how much you tweaked it but it looks inviting yet beautifully dark) and the framing/crop really works.  A lovely interpretation of the challenge.  Well done! :)', '2007-12-05 18:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4293675, 618820, 85886, '<td valign="top">I like the shot and what I think you''re trying to do but this is one of those images that feels overedited with too many filters and post processing.  I really think it would do better in simple black and white with only level tweaks.</td>', 'I like the shot and what I think you''re trying to do but this is one of those images that feels overedited with too many filters and post processing.  I really think it would do better in simple black and white with only level tweaks.', '2007-12-05 18:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4293680, 618318, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation and lovely photo.  I really like that the apple looks sinister from the colouring, and the contrast effect of the apple against the relatively monotone model (with nice DoF).  Good work!!</td>', 'Great interpretation and lovely photo.  I really like that the apple looks sinister from the colouring, and the contrast effect of the apple against the relatively monotone model (with nice DoF).  Good work!!', '2007-12-05 18:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4293683, 619106, 85886, '<td valign="top">Interesting and eerie colouring.  For me the only let down is the sky - it just doesn''t sit right for me and somehow draws attention away from the rest of the scene...</td>', 'Interesting and eerie colouring.  For me the only let down is the sky - it just doesn''t sit right for me and somehow draws attention away from the rest of the scene...', '2007-12-05 18:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4293686, 619112, 85886, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!  I''m only new around here but if I were a betting man I''d be betting that this gets a ribbon.  Great colours, detail, composition...all in a really appealing and directly relevant photo.  Fantastic.</td>', 'Brilliant!  I''m only new around here but if I were a betting man I''d be betting that this gets a ribbon.  Great colours, detail, composition...all in a really appealing and directly relevant photo.  Fantastic.', '2007-12-05 18:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4293692, 618805, 85886, '<td valign="top">Fan-flipping-tastic!!!  Perfect in every way to these eyes and this mind.  The lighting, colour palette, composition, interpretation...even the expression on the model''s face.  Outstanding.</td>', 'Fan-flipping-tastic!!!  Perfect in every way to these eyes and this mind.  The lighting, colour palette, composition, interpretation...even the expression on the model''s face.  Outstanding.', '2007-12-05 19:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4293701, 618436, 85886, '<td valign="top">Compositionally this is confusing without any real focus imho.  I can see the eyes on Prince Charming but it would have been better to get a bit more of the Prince''s face in shot to capture the essence of the scene.  Also, given the amount of editing that seems to go on for the Advanced Editing rule challenges I think you could probably have done better with their eyes, especially seeing as that''s the title!  Hope this helps.</td>', 'Compositionally this is confusing without any real focus imho.  I can see the eyes on Prince Charming but it would have been better to get a bit more of the Prince''s face in shot to capture the essence of the scene.  Also, given the amount of editing that seems to go on for the Advanced Editing rule challenges I think you could probably have done better with their eyes, especially seeing as that''s the title!  Hope this helps.', '2007-12-05 19:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4293707, 619223, 85886, '<td valign="top">An interesting picture but unfortunately I just don''t get it.  I can see burned matchsticks in what appears to be water and someone going to pick one up.  I just don''t get what''s going on here...or what makes it particularly "Fairy Tale".  As a photo it''s really interesting and thought provoking, but as a Fairy Tale it''s just too much of a reach.</td>', 'An interesting picture but unfortunately I just don''t get it.  I can see burned matchsticks in what appears to be water and someone going to pick one up.  I just don''t get what''s going on here...or what makes it particularly "Fairy Tale".  As a photo it''s really interesting and thought provoking, but as a Fairy Tale it''s just too much of a reach.', '2007-12-05 19:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4293709, 618981, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great subject but for me the building up behind the trees on the right really destroys the fairy tale spell.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'Great subject but for me the building up behind the trees on the right really destroys the fairy tale spell.  Nice shot though.', '2007-12-05 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
