(4295279, 618805, 81382, '<td valign="top">Love the fingers around the apple, nice and simple concept. On the composition side of things, could have done with getting rid of some of the empty space of the left to centre up the subject a bit more.</td>', 'Love the fingers around the apple, nice and simple concept. On the composition side of things, could have done with getting rid of some of the empty space of the left to centre up the subject a bit more.', '2007-12-06 08:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4295282, 619106, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and wide angle. Just not sure about the colour scheme, the white on the top of the trees and then the orange is a little distracting and takes the focus away from the throne, which itself could do with a bit of a tonal range boost to make it more dramatic in the otherwise fairly flat surroundings.</td>', 'Lovely composition and wide angle. Just not sure about the colour scheme, the white on the top of the trees and then the orange is a little distracting and takes the focus away from the throne, which itself could do with a bit of a tonal range boost to make it more dramatic in the otherwise fairly flat surroundings.', '2007-12-06 08:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4295287, 619153, 81382, '<td valign="top">Not sure the motion blur on the left works for me. Quite a lot of empty space a the bottom of the image which would have worked better if there was perhaps some footprints to lead the eye into the image and towards the woodsman.</td>', 'Not sure the motion blur on the left works for me. Quite a lot of empty space a the bottom of the image which would have worked better if there was perhaps some footprints to lead the eye into the image and towards the woodsman.', '2007-12-06 08:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4295293, 619120, 81382, '<td valign="top">Just seems a little out of focus. You may have intentionally gone for a dreamy fairy tale bloom/blur effect during post processing but I feel the eyes just are not as sharp as they could be. Perhaps just a bit of sharpening on the eyes or even just a small USM after the resize to 640 would have made all the difference.</td>', 'Just seems a little out of focus. You may have intentionally gone for a dreamy fairy tale bloom/blur effect during post processing but I feel the eyes just are not as sharp as they could be. Perhaps just a bit of sharpening on the eyes or even just a small USM after the resize to 640 would have made all the difference.', '2007-12-06 08:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4295296, 619214, 81382, '<td valign="top">You seem to have a vertical grainy effect going on and I''m unsure as to whether or not this was intentional or due to a limited colour palette, high ISO noise or some other resizing artifacts. Whatever the reason, it does rather take the focus off the girl which otherwise is well composed and has lovely sharpness to the eyes.</td>', 'You seem to have a vertical grainy effect going on and I''m unsure as to whether or not this was intentional or due to a limited colour palette, high ISO noise or some other resizing artifacts. Whatever the reason, it does rather take the focus off the girl which otherwise is well composed and has lovely sharpness to the eyes.', '2007-12-06 08:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4295678, 617171, 35804, '<td valign="top">...there is simply too much going on here.</td>', '...there is simply too much going on here.', '2007-12-06 10:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
