(4296750, 618666, 85271, '<td valign="top">Very original/off the beaten path.</td>', 'Very original/off the beaten path.', '2007-12-06 17:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297005, 618666, 84907, '<td valign="top">Ok, I admit I don''t get the title at all.  That being said my score isn''t based upon MY understanding.  My score is based upon the shot.  I like the portrait orientation, and the way you have used DOF background blur.  The light at the top of the shot adds interest for me and while I am sure there will be those that mark you down for challenge relevance, but for me the shot stands on its own.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'Ok, I admit I don''t get the title at all.  That being said my score isn''t based upon MY understanding.  My score is based upon the shot.  I like the portrait orientation, and the way you have used DOF background blur.  The light at the top of the shot adds interest for me and while I am sure there will be those that mark you down for challenge relevance, but for me the shot stands on its own.  Very nice shot.', '2007-12-06 18:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297015, 619223, 84907, '<td valign="top">The shot brings lots of interest.  I am a bit lost with the busyness of the background as it merges with the shadow and matches.</td>', 'The shot brings lots of interest.  I am a bit lost with the busyness of the background as it merges with the shadow and matches.', '2007-12-06 18:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297027, 619057, 84907, '<td valign="top">I really like the novelty of the shot.  The shadow play adds interest and makes the image stick out.  I would be curious what the shot would look like if there were equal lighting on both sides.</td>', 'I really like the novelty of the shot.  The shadow play adds interest and makes the image stick out.  I would be curious what the shot would look like if there were equal lighting on both sides.', '2007-12-06 18:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297030, 618372, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a great deal.  Nice wide angle look, and the misty/foggy look is excellent.  Use of the path to draw the eye through the shot is wonderful for the shot and the foreground elements frame the shot up very very well.  Great shot!</td>', 'I like this shot a great deal.  Nice wide angle look, and the misty/foggy look is excellent.  Use of the path to draw the eye through the shot is wonderful for the shot and the foreground elements frame the shot up very very well.  Great shot!', '2007-12-06 18:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297050, 618244, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the set up and idea of the shot!  I really like the lighting on the model''s hand.  That being said the lighting also seems to have taken the candle completely out of the shot for me.  The image still scores well from me, but that would be my only area to take a look at.</td>', 'I like the set up and idea of the shot!  I really like the lighting on the model''s hand.  That being said the lighting also seems to have taken the candle completely out of the shot for me.  The image still scores well from me, but that would be my only area to take a look at.', '2007-12-06 19:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297071, 619181, 84907, '<td valign="top">I have a couple of things on this one.  The PP leaves me with a very undefined metal gate.  The tree right in front of the gate the looks very over processed for my taste.  I love post processing, but this shot falls in between two things for me.  If you go to big PP I can love that if the whole image is processed in that way, but the foreground character is not processed in the same way and that leaves me without continuity.</td>', 'I have a couple of things on this one.  The PP leaves me with a very undefined metal gate.  The tree right in front of the gate the looks very over processed for my taste.  I love post processing, but this shot falls in between two things for me.  If you go to big PP I can love that if the whole image is processed in that way, but the foreground character is not processed in the same way and that leaves me without continuity.', '2007-12-06 19:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297086, 618805, 84907, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  The lighting is fantastic.  The pop of the eyes is excellent, the bright spot on the apple is wonderful.  The shadows on the left side (her right) again right on the mark.  The only thing that I see that I am not sure about is the dark spot on the nose.  My guess is that is supposed to be a hairy wart, but it steals my attention more than it adds to the shot.  Still a spectacular shot and wart or no it does not impact my excellent score on this wonderful shot.</td>', 'I love this shot.  The lighting is fantastic.  The pop of the eyes is excellent, the bright spot on the apple is wonderful.  The shadows on the left side (her right) again right on the mark.  The only thing that I see that I am not sure about is the dark spot on the nose.  My guess is that is supposed to be a hairy wart, but it steals my attention more than it adds to the shot.  Still a spectacular shot and wart or no it does not impact my excellent score on this wonderful shot.', '2007-12-06 19:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297089, 619201, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but would rather see a different background color to bring out the blue in the sack.</td>', 'I like the idea but would rather see a different background color to bring out the blue in the sack.', '2007-12-06 19:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297098, 618698, 84907, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and smoke.  The face is just right with enough there but masked enough as well.  The lamp has some serious funky grip going on there, and can take away some focus from the great capture on the right side of the image.  I could even see just a portion of the lamp in the shot so the smoke looks like it is rising from out of the lamp and also cutting out the aforementioned crazy grip of doom.</td>', 'I love the lighting and smoke.  The face is just right with enough there but masked enough as well.  The lamp has some serious funky grip going on there, and can take away some focus from the great capture on the right side of the image.  I could even see just a portion of the lamp in the shot so the smoke looks like it is rising from out of the lamp and also cutting out the aforementioned crazy grip of doom.', '2007-12-06 19:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297160, 619248, 86849, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, I love the expression of the face. <br/>The light or focust could be slightly softer, to make it more misterious (IMO)</td>', 'Very nice picture, I love the expression of the face. The light or focust could be slightly softer, to make it more misterious (IMO)', '2007-12-06 19:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297166, 618805, 86849, '<td valign="top">I like the light and the make up int this picture</td>', 'I like the light and the make up int this picture', '2007-12-06 19:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297170, 618959, 86849, '<td valign="top">whery nicely taken picture which tells a story. I like the choice of colors here too</td>', 'whery nicely taken picture which tells a story. I like the choice of colors here too', '2007-12-06 19:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297187, 619220, 86849, '<td valign="top">interesting choice of colors</td>', 'interesting choice of colors', '2007-12-06 19:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297224, 619089, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the framing.  The background is a bit too close to really give it the kind of blur that would make it quite a different image.  The partially focused background adds an interesting element because it is of course related to Pinocchio.  Solid image.</td>', 'I like the framing.  The background is a bit too close to really give it the kind of blur that would make it quite a different image.  The partially focused background adds an interesting element because it is of course related to Pinocchio.  Solid image.', '2007-12-06 20:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297237, 619146, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like both the the thought and the execution of the shot.  There are some noise issues in the shadowy areas most notably on the right of our enchanted friend towards the bottom right of him.  Clearly the size that one must save the images in impacts this, but a bit more lighting might have helped.  Still a very nice image.</td>', 'I like both the the thought and the execution of the shot.  There are some noise issues in the shadowy areas most notably on the right of our enchanted friend towards the bottom right of him.  Clearly the size that one must save the images in impacts this, but a bit more lighting might have helped.  Still a very nice image.', '2007-12-06 20:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297245, 619165, 84907, '<td valign="top">This says Larus to me, and if I am wrong well then it is a huge compliment to whoever actually took the shot.  Lighting is amazing, and the pop in the eyes is excellent.  Use of the white flakes is excellent.  Just an amazing shot and my favorite so far.  I would love to hear how many lights and placement on this one.</td>', 'This says Larus to me, and if I am wrong well then it is a huge compliment to whoever actually took the shot.  Lighting is amazing, and the pop in the eyes is excellent.  Use of the white flakes is excellent.  Just an amazing shot and my favorite so far.  I would love to hear how many lights and placement on this one.', '2007-12-06 20:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297247, 619205, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the selective color use, and the subject  :)</td>', 'I like the selective color use, and the subject  :)', '2007-12-06 20:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297252, 619147, 84907, '<td valign="top">I love the bread crumb and leaf background.  While I know the shoes are there intentionally, I would love to either see more of them or none of them.  To me they serve to distract more than they serve to add.  However ass the main focus is the bread, I think you did a tremendous job with that.  Very crisp shot.</td>', 'I love the bread crumb and leaf background.  While I know the shoes are there intentionally, I would love to either see more of them or none of them.  To me they serve to distract more than they serve to add.  However ass the main focus is the bread, I think you did a tremendous job with that.  Very crisp shot.', '2007-12-06 20:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297257, 618736, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like the blue purple light!  I like the low light effect and the hurricane lamp adds just the right feel.  Very solid image and scores very well from me.</td>', 'I like the blue purple light!  I like the low light effect and the hurricane lamp adds just the right feel.  Very solid image and scores very well from me.', '2007-12-06 20:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297262, 619130, 84907, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot.  Centering the rose leaves a bit too much dead space in the photo for me, but still a very nice capture and presentation.</td>', 'I really like the shot.  Centering the rose leaves a bit too much dead space in the photo for me, but still a very nice capture and presentation.', '2007-12-06 20:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297271, 619112, 84907, '<td valign="top">I love the creative use of a sparkler  :)  Nice shot and well framed.</td>', 'I love the creative use of a sparkler  :)  Nice shot and well framed.', '2007-12-06 20:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297276, 619026, 84907, '<td valign="top">LOL  :)  I love it.  Fun take on the fairy tale.  With regards to the shot I can see some pretty clear circles on the ceiling that have pretty tell tell dodging and burning characteristics.</td>', 'LOL  :)  I love it.  Fun take on the fairy tale.  With regards to the shot I can see some pretty clear circles on the ceiling that have pretty tell tell dodging and burning characteristics.', '2007-12-06 20:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297287, 618958, 84907, '<td valign="top">A nice shot.  Might have been even better if the little guy or gals footprints were the first to break the snow instead of the car tracks all the way back in.</td>', 'A nice shot.  Might have been even better if the little guy or gals footprints were the first to break the snow instead of the car tracks all the way back in.', '2007-12-06 20:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297292, 618961, 84907, '<td valign="top">The background does this shot in for me.  I think I could probably go for the house type background but the Christmas lights ruin this for me.  I like the presentation of the dress though.</td>', 'The background does this shot in for me.  I think I could probably go for the house type background but the Christmas lights ruin this for me.  I like the presentation of the dress though.', '2007-12-06 20:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297301, 619055, 84907, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  The tinting is excellent and oddly enough the veins in the eyelids I would actually say even add to the shot.  Somehow that is instantly where my eye was drawn and it adds to the shot for me.  A great take on the challenge and I am sure this shot will do well.</td>', 'I like this one.  The tinting is excellent and oddly enough the veins in the eyelids I would actually say even add to the shot.  Somehow that is instantly where my eye was drawn and it adds to the shot for me.  A great take on the challenge and I am sure this shot will do well.', '2007-12-06 20:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297306, 619222, 84907, '<td valign="top">Serious noise issues for me and the background buildings behind the tree have something funky going on.  Not entirely certain what it is, but it attracts my eye and not in a good way.  All that being said I can''t imagine how tough this shot would be with all of the various light sources and trying to balance all that out in a clearly night shot would be almost impossible.  Thank you for sharing the shot with us.</td>', 'Serious noise issues for me and the background buildings behind the tree have something funky going on.  Not entirely certain what it is, but it attracts my eye and not in a good way.  All that being said I can''t imagine how tough this shot would be with all of the various light sources and trying to balance all that out in a clearly night shot would be almost impossible.  Thank you for sharing the shot with us.', '2007-12-06 20:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4297320, 618716, 84907, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast of the white and the blue hues.  Great capture.  The expression is excellent on the model''s face as well.  The eyelashes might be a bit much for me, but that is tremendously nitpicky.  Great job.</td>', 'I love the contrast of the white and the blue hues.  Great capture.  The expression is excellent on the model''s face as well.  The eyelashes might be a bit much for me, but that is tremendously nitpicky.  Great job.', '2007-12-06 20:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
