(4298415, 618666, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the shot Christian.</td>', 'Nice job on the shot Christian.', '2007-12-07 08:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298418, 618946, 23484, '<td valign="top">Neat job on the processing.</td>', 'Neat job on the processing.', '2007-12-07 08:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298421, 618959, 23484, '<td valign="top">Good job on this. I like the tone.</td>', 'Good job on this. I like the tone.', '2007-12-07 08:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298423, 619243, 23484, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2007-12-07 08:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298425, 619053, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great job.</td>', 'Great job.', '2007-12-07 08:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298426, 618958, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot. Great angle.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot. Great angle.', '2007-12-07 08:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298428, 619181, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot. Good job on the spooky effect.</td>', 'This is a really cool shot. Good job on the spooky effect.', '2007-12-07 08:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298431, 618333, 23484, '<td valign="top">Yikes! Now that''s a frightning thought. Excellent job.</td>', 'Yikes! Now that''s a frightning thought. Excellent job.', '2007-12-07 08:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298436, 617171, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the texture and effect of this photo. You did good with the surreal look. The things that are on the tree are a little distracting only because with the distance I can''t tell what they are or how they play into the story.</td>', 'I like the texture and effect of this photo. You did good with the surreal look. The things that are on the tree are a little distracting only because with the distance I can''t tell what they are or how they play into the story.', '2007-12-07 08:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298439, 618369, 61971, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job on the eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful job on the eyes.', '2007-12-07 08:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298440, 619106, 61971, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this. The trees being so light in the background are pulling my eyes away from the subject though.</td>', 'I love the idea of this. The trees being so light in the background are pulling my eyes away from the subject though.', '2007-12-07 08:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298443, 619123, 61971, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horse. The concept is good, except for the dog. The dog really kills it for me. This would have been a knock out with her on the dark horse calling me into the Enchanted Forest. imo.</td>', 'Beautiful horse. The concept is good, except for the dog. The dog really kills it for me. This would have been a knock out with her on the dark horse calling me into the Enchanted Forest. imo.', '2007-12-07 08:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298450, 619243, 61971, '<td valign="top">Great tones. I like the subtle vignetting. I would prefer a little greater dof though to bring out the texture in the church.</td>', 'Great tones. I like the subtle vignetting. I would prefer a little greater dof though to bring out the texture in the church.', '2007-12-07 08:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298453, 618244, 61971, '<td valign="top">Great concept. I love the vines around the mirror. The flame pulls away from the greater subject imo.</td>', 'Great concept. I love the vines around the mirror. The flame pulls away from the greater subject imo.', '2007-12-07 08:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298462, 618961, 61971, '<td valign="top">I am a fan of selective desat, so the color and tones work well for me. I just don''t feel this picture though. I don''t know if its the mannequin or the barbed wire/christmas lights around the window, jmo.</td>', 'I am a fan of selective desat, so the color and tones work well for me. I just don''t feel this picture though. I don''t know if its the mannequin or the barbed wire/christmas lights around the window, jmo.', '2007-12-07 08:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298465, 619048, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture and reflections. With the firey bokeh effects this all looks very Terminator 2. Lovely composition, the title doesn''t mean anything to me but I''ll take you word on that. The only thing that is a bit of a shame is apart from the aforementioned firey bokeh in the top right corner which is great, the rest of the background is similarly coloured and of the same illumination as the figure and so the figure would have had more impact had the background been more discreet.</td>', 'Lovely texture and reflections. With the firey bokeh effects this all looks very Terminator 2. Lovely composition, the title doesn''t mean anything to me but I''ll take you word on that. The only thing that is a bit of a shame is apart from the aforementioned firey bokeh in the top right corner which is great, the rest of the background is similarly coloured and of the same illumination as the figure and so the figure would have had more impact had the background been more discreet.', '2007-12-07 08:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298469, 619134, 61971, '<td valign="top">Imo, it meets the challenge. But it really doesn''t fit well to me. Her surroundings give away to more of a modern day back yard feel. There are too many different types of plants here. So instead of noticing the story I am drawn to the plants instead. I think this would have worked better just grass or even in a pile of leaves.</td>', 'Imo, it meets the challenge. But it really doesn''t fit well to me. Her surroundings give away to more of a modern day back yard feel. There are too many different types of plants here. So instead of noticing the story I am drawn to the plants instead. I think this would have worked better just grass or even in a pile of leaves.', '2007-12-07 09:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298472, 618948, 81382, '<td valign="top">Excellent mono conversion, and great capture of the moment. A lot of entries to these challenges afford multiple shots to get things perfect and I myself have spent hours over a single image, but here you will only have had a very small window to reel off some memory card space so you''ve done well. Great natural expressions and well composed although could perhaps have done with a little clockwise rotation during cropping to get your vertical lines in the background vertical.</td>', 'Excellent mono conversion, and great capture of the moment. A lot of entries to these challenges afford multiple shots to get things perfect and I myself have spent hours over a single image, but here you will only have had a very small window to reel off some memory card space so you''ve done well. Great natural expressions and well composed although could perhaps have done with a little clockwise rotation during cropping to get your vertical lines in the background vertical.', '2007-12-07 09:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298479, 618372, 61971, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in that forest. It really makes you feel like there could be a big bad wolf waiting for you. Imo, the composition feels a little off, the foggy area on the top are a little distracting, and that wonderfully creepy forest is fighting with the green of the forground for attention. The concept is perfect!</td>', 'I love the lighting in that forest. It really makes you feel like there could be a big bad wolf waiting for you. Imo, the composition feels a little off, the foggy area on the top are a little distracting, and that wonderfully creepy forest is fighting with the green of the forground for attention. The concept is perfect!', '2007-12-07 09:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298483, 619249, 61971, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Imo the bokeh in the background is very complimentary, however the colors are not. I would love to see this with the background selected and desaturated and then toned in to be just a bit lighter than the fairy''s skin.</td>', 'Very cute. Imo the bokeh in the background is very complimentary, however the colors are not. I would love to see this with the background selected and desaturated and then toned in to be just a bit lighter than the fairy''s skin.', '2007-12-07 09:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298493, 618981, 61971, '<td valign="top">The dress is very colorful. This picture isn''t getting me for the simple fact that I feel like its a shot you caught somewhere and said oh, I can make it fit the challenge somehow. As a photograph I like the processing, the soft glowy feel is nice.</td>', 'The dress is very colorful. This picture isn''t getting me for the simple fact that I feel like its a shot you caught somewhere and said oh, I can make it fit the challenge somehow. As a photograph I like the processing, the soft glowy feel is nice.', '2007-12-07 09:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298504, 619147, 61971, '<td valign="top">Great texture in the leaves. This would have really rocked me if the shoes where brown boots or something along those lines that fit the historical aspect of this tale a little better. Other than those sneakers this perspective with the crumb being the main focus is a really great take on this challenge.</td>', 'Great texture in the leaves. This would have really rocked me if the shoes where brown boots or something along those lines that fit the historical aspect of this tale a little better. Other than those sneakers this perspective with the crumb being the main focus is a really great take on this challenge.', '2007-12-07 09:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298538, 618666, 61971, '<td valign="top">Love the black and white, love the texture. I am going to assume that this is a piece of bread and not a rock. The white puff up top pulls my eye though. Would have been a great use of space had that been cropped out imo. The black and white treatment of the photo is nice and makes it stand out from the other Hansel and Gretel pics.</td>', 'Love the black and white, love the texture. I am going to assume that this is a piece of bread and not a rock. The white puff up top pulls my eye though. Would have been a great use of space had that been cropped out imo. The black and white treatment of the photo is nice and makes it stand out from the other Hansel and Gretel pics.', '2007-12-07 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4298561, 619063, 61971, '<td valign="top">Im not really keen on the processing. Makes it look too much like a painting. If you take that away I would have loved this. The natural texture of the skin and the beans. The selective desat works well.</td>', 'Im not really keen on the processing. Makes it look too much like a painting. If you take that away I would have loved this. The natural texture of the skin and the beans. The selective desat works well.', '2007-12-07 09:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
