(4299436, 618436, 63269, '<td valign="top">If there was any way to get rid of the grain that would majorly help, although shooting in the dark like this is always really hard! If your camera has an ISO setting, lowering that should eliminate the grain.</td>', 'If there was any way to get rid of the grain that would majorly help, although shooting in the dark like this is always really hard! If your camera has an ISO setting, lowering that should eliminate the grain.', '2007-12-07 16:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
