(4304530, 617171, 67697, '<td valign="top">Interesting and different.  Love how the soft colors kind of blur together.  Now the only thing the guy needs is a beard ;)</td>', 'Interesting and different.  Love how the soft colors kind of blur together.  Now the only thing the guy needs is a beard ;)', '2007-12-09 22:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
