(4304538, 619222, 67697, '<td valign="top">I don''t totally understand the title but I do like the pic.  The lighting on the buildings is cool and my fave part is how the color of the lihgts on the tree stand out from everything else. The angels kind of get lost in everything which is unfortunate. I would like to have seen this brought in just a little closer to make the tree more prominent.</td>', 'I don''t totally understand the title but I do like the pic.  The lighting on the buildings is cool and my fave part is how the color of the lihgts on the tree stand out from everything else. The angels kind of get lost in everything which is unfortunate. I would like to have seen this brought in just a little closer to make the tree more prominent.', '2007-12-09 22:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304539, 618820, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like it - dark and eerie - pretty cool!  Love the shadow from the tree.</td>', 'I like it - dark and eerie - pretty cool!  Love the shadow from the tree.', '2007-12-09 22:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4304544, 619183, 67697, '<td valign="top">Perfect!  Love the colors and the sparks.  I''m waiting for the pumpkin to turn into the stage coach!</td>', 'Perfect!  Love the colors and the sparks.  I''m waiting for the pumpkin to turn into the stage coach!', '2007-12-09 22:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
