(4305314, 619112, 68035, '<td valign="top">hahaha...Karen you and I really need to have a discussion about what makes a ''bad'' shot (can I point you in the direction of my challenge portfolio if you require some illustrations)<br/> <br/>When I was scoring the challenge I had thought this was a greta idea and was quite envious of how you had caught the sparkler in action (though I would have liked all the sparkles contained in the image)<br/> <br/>I like the leading diagonal and the placement on points of thirds.  Maybe not one of your stop me dead in my tracks images but still a picture that I would have been more than happy to take myself<br/> <br/>Good job</td>', 'hahaha...Karen you and I really need to have a discussion about what makes a ''bad'' shot (can I point you in the direction of my challenge portfolio if you require some illustrations) When I was scoring the challenge I had thought this was a greta idea and was quite envious of how you had caught the sparkler in action (though I would have liked all the sparkles contained in the image) I like the leading diagonal and the placement on points of thirds.  Maybe not one of your stop me dead in my tracks images but still a picture that I would have been more than happy to take myself Good job', '2007-12-10 04:38:13.000000', NULL, 0),
