(4305323, 619223, 68035, '<td valign="top">hmmmm yes lets not talk about the story of the little match girl as I am a chap and therefore suppose to be TOUGH.  There were a few LMG images in the challenge and this had (genuinely) been my favourite of them<br/> <br/>Love the B&amp;W (and knowing the story the dead matches are a poigniant depiction of it) and I thought that the shadow ''picking up'' the dead match was a very clever touch.  From my perspective I may have liked to see a bit more space between the spent matches and the border, but I thought this was a cool shot</td>', 'hmmmm yes lets not talk about the story of the little match girl as I am a chap and therefore suppose to be TOUGH.  There were a few LMG images in the challenge and this had (genuinely) been my favourite of them Love the B&W (and knowing the story the dead matches are a poigniant depiction of it) and I thought that the shadow ''picking up'' the dead match was a very clever touch.  From my perspective I may have liked to see a bit more space between the spent matches and the border, but I thought this was a cool shot', '2007-12-10 04:42:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4305324, 618805, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hehe, sorry about that :)</td>', 'Hehe, sorry about that :)', '2007-12-10 04:42:27.000000', NULL, 0),
