(4305404, 618922, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey shez .. i''m sorry this didnt do better for you .. there were some amazing entries in this challenge .. well i looked at the first six or seven !! .. i personally reckon this is a brilliant image .. the colours are amazing .. its a definite wow from me .. :) .. i''m not going to look at the photographs that beat you or i might get angry at the silly voters .. !! .. <br/>10 minutes later ... well i couldnt help myself .. i had a look ... up to 50th place ..  the voters seem to have got it wrong again .. !! ... :)</td>', 'hey shez .. i''m sorry this didnt do better for you .. there were some amazing entries in this challenge .. well i looked at the first six or seven !! .. i personally reckon this is a brilliant image .. the colours are amazing .. its a definite wow from me .. :) .. i''m not going to look at the photographs that beat you or i might get angry at the silly voters .. !! .. 10 minutes later ... well i couldnt help myself .. i had a look ... up to 50th place ..  the voters seem to have got it wrong again .. !! ... :)', '2007-12-10 05:30:36.000000', NULL, 0),
