(4305503, 618856, 80058, '<td valign="top">I feel your pain!!!!! But hey, don''t work up too much about it, but I guess you do have to take into consideration that this is an international site and I think the tale you chose was a bit too unknown for alot of the voters and that''s a fact, I agree that alot of snapshots seem to have beat your image BUT that''s entirely because they chose well known tales =/<br/> <br/></td>', 'I feel your pain!!!!! But hey, don''t work up too much about it, but I guess you do have to take into consideration that this is an international site and I think the tale you chose was a bit too unknown for alot of the voters and that''s a fact, I agree that alot of snapshots seem to have beat your image BUT that''s entirely because they chose well known tales =/ ', '2007-12-10 06:34:26.000000', NULL, 0),
