(4309598, 619165, 46448, '<td valign="top">This is Photographed well, usual to your style, perfected lighting and the background is awesome, eyes do it well. However something is just off.. the "snow effect" is applied half slapstick, and doesn''t add alot. the "ice crystals" in the hair are strange at best they don''t make sense at the places they are. The eyebrows are just strange, something isn''t right or natural about them, too fake almost. You have great stuff Larus, but I know you can do better with the same concept!</td>', 'This is Photographed well, usual to your style, perfected lighting and the background is awesome, eyes do it well. However something is just off.. the "snow effect" is applied half slapstick, and doesn''t add alot. the "ice crystals" in the hair are strange at best they don''t make sense at the places they are. The eyebrows are just strange, something isn''t right or natural about them, too fake almost. You have great stuff Larus, but I know you can do better with the same concept!', '2007-12-12 01:26:53.000000', NULL, 0),
