(4317734, 618333, 60862, '<td valign="top">Tim, you''re well on your way to being one of the most faved shots on DPC.  Add mine to the pile. :)  The great concept and the funny story are wonderful, and the little details (pliers, tattoo, teddy bear, and dress socks pulled all the way up) just add so much to it.<br/> <br/>Just think, in 30 years you''ll look at your profile page and think "man, i wish I were in that good shape again." *grin*</td>', 'Tim, you''re well on your way to being one of the most faved shots on DPC.  Add mine to the pile. :)  The great concept and the funny story are wonderful, and the little details (pliers, tattoo, teddy bear, and dress socks pulled all the way up) just add so much to it. Just think, in 30 years you''ll look at your profile page and think "man, i wish I were in that good shape again." *grin*', '2007-12-17 00:11:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4321532, 619210, 32872, '<td valign="top">I added light on the tree and cabin, plus I added smoke and changed around some shadows on the bottom left.  I was playing artist in my  mind and not photgrapher.  I show and sale paintings for extra money and I swear to everyone...my mind was on overload and I did not submit this to trick or deceive anyone.  Actually there is no excuse for not adhering to the rules.<br/> <br/>I''ve beat myself up long enough!  I put my camera away for the past 2 weeks.  I just took it back out today and it felt so good to take images again!<br/> <br/>Please forgive me everyone.<br/> <br/>Darlene<br/></td>', 'I added light on the tree and cabin, plus I added smoke and changed around some shadows on the bottom left.  I was playing artist in my  mind and not photgrapher.  I show and sale paintings for extra money and I swear to everyone...my mind was on overload and I did not submit this to trick or deceive anyone.  Actually there is no excuse for not adhering to the rules. I''ve beat myself up long enough!  I put my camera away for the past 2 weeks.  I just took it back out today and it felt so good to take images again! Please forgive me everyone. Darlene', '2007-12-18 22:18:44.000000', NULL, 0),
