(4330689, 617080, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hey, look at your commenter avg. score.  You found your audience! :)  I have to admit this isn''t to my taste especially, but as we''ve discussed before, it''d be a sad day if you stopped expressing your own vision in favor of DPC voters'' desires.</td>', 'Hey, look at your commenter avg. score.  You found your audience! :)  I have to admit this isn''t to my taste especially, but as we''ve discussed before, it''d be a sad day if you stopped expressing your own vision in favor of DPC voters'' desires.', '2007-12-23 00:22:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4344682, 618805, 85886, '<td valign="top">You definitely should have ribboned with this shot - if it hadn''t been for the 24 people that voted this image 5 or less (which is completely unreasonable under any circumstance or opinion) then it probably would have.  Gonna favourite it now just to prove a point! FWIW I voted this a 10.</td>', 'You definitely should have ribboned with this shot - if it hadn''t been for the 24 people that voted this image 5 or less (which is completely unreasonable under any circumstance or opinion) then it probably would have.  Gonna favourite it now just to prove a point! FWIW I voted this a 10.', '2007-12-30 09:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
