(4349342, 619210, 18450, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful image, perfect for a Christmas card! <br/> <br/>..... and don''t beat yourself up on this one Darlene, I did exactly the same once. Got carried away using layers and masks and changing modes in a basic challenge....forgot what I was doing. Had been busy editing stock pics, quickly edited my challenge entry, uploaded it ..... was a basic challenge and was justifiably DQ.</td>', 'What a wonderful image, perfect for a Christmas card!  ..... and don''t beat yourself up on this one Darlene, I did exactly the same once. Got carried away using layers and masks and changing modes in a basic challenge....forgot what I was doing. Had been busy editing stock pics, quickly edited my challenge entry, uploaded it ..... was a basic challenge and was justifiably DQ.', '2008-01-01 06:20:15.000000', NULL, 0),
